%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrap": true, "width": 130, "actorMargin": 40, "messageMargin": 28, "noteMargin": 6}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant MR as MediaRepair<br/>(1-min tick)
  participant Q as SQS
  participant PC as Processing<br/>Commands
  participant PDB as processing_db
  participant L as Processing<br/>Launcher
  participant E as Fargate encoder
  participant S as S3 buckets
  MR->>Q: claim outbox row, send submit (processing-commands)
  Q->>PC: event source mapping
  PC->>PDB: inbox, guard, Job + Attempt 1 queued, outbox work + result v1
  PC->>Q: work (processing-work), result v1 (media-results)
  PC->>L: wake (async invoke)
  L->>PDB: reserve launch slot (cap 3)
  L->>E: RunTask with stable token and deadline
  E->>Q: receive work
  E->>PDB: claim: lease on DB clock, bind task, processing, outbox result v2
  E->>S: GET source at pinned VersionId, verify SHA-256
  E->>E: ffprobe, MP4, HLS ladder (≤ source height)
  E->>S: PUT jobs/{job}/attempts/{attempt}/...
  E->>PDB: finish under live lease: done, outputs, outbox result v3
  E->>Q: delete work message, exit when idle
